/// in-memory ring as the pure-host default. The file sink that writes the
/// CLI's own `fa.log` format lives behind `lib/io.dart` — no `dart:io`
/// here (hard invariant; web compilation stays clean).
///
/// Pure Dart: no `dart:io`.
library;

